  "description": "On her way home, Butterfly encounters Logan, a water creature abandoned in an alley. Feeling a sense of urgency about abandoning him, and harboring a slight selfish attachment to Logan's body and face, she takes him home. Clearly, she intended to provide him with only temporary care. Just temporary care... But how could she, born a woman of integrity, turn down such a face and body?\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
